{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30867","headline":"詶李景章先辈 · 马戴","name":"詶李景章先辈","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"平生诗句忝多同，不得陪君奉至公。\n金镝自宜先中鹄，铅刀甘且学雕虫。\n莺啼细柳临关路，燕接飞花遶汉宫。\n九陌芳菲人竞赏，此时心在别离中。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"马戴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30867.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30867","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}